{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54443","headline":"送人游交趾 · 陈光","name":"送人游交趾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挂席天涯去，想君万里心。\n人间无别业，海外访知音。\n浪歇龙涎聚，沙虚象迹深。\n往来应隔阔，须自惜光阴。\n（同前第四四四九页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}